@startuml engine-internals
title Engine internals
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Engine" {
    [Patch\nuniverses + FID->fixture map\ndirty set] as patch
    [TimeContext\nnow · dt · frame] as time
    [Frame\nFID->FixtureValues\nrebuilt each tick] as frame
    [ProgrammerLayer\npriority 1000] as prog
    [m_layers: vector<Layer*>\ncomposed low->high] as layers
    [Stored\nobject pools] as stored
    [DMXOutput\nsACN senders] as output
    [CommandParser + CommandExecutor\npImpl via unique_ptr] as parser
}

prog ..> layers : registered in
layers --> frame : apply
frame --> patch : Resolve
patch --> output : buffers
prog --> patch : resolves FIDs
stored --> prog : recall onto
parser --> patch : drives facade
@enduml
